cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this experimental project as an implementation derived from the host-collected source. Do not imply production qualification."
title: "GTX 1080 Ti to HPE DL380 Gen9 iLO 4 via OCSD"
version: "0.1.0-rc2"
date-released: "2026-11-24"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/oceanmedianow/gen9-t4-ocsd-thermal-bridge"
abstract: >-
  Experimental host-side publisher for forwarding NVIDIA GPU temperature into
  a HPE Gen9 OCSD option-card record. Qualified only on one HPE DL380 Gen9,
  iLO 4 2.77, GTX 1080 Ti Founders Edition, and standard fans. Fan-control
  causality and production readiness are not yet verified.
keywords:
  - HPE
  - iLO 4
  - OCSD
  - Proxmox
  - NVIDIA
  - GTX 1080 Ti
